  "analysis": "I've read the draft.txt file and the SKILL.md documentation. The draft.txt contains very AI-generated text with typical patterns: 'Great question!' opener, buzzwords like 'transformative solution', 'leverages', 'empower users', 'pivotal moment', 'user-centric thinking', triple adjectives like 'intuitive, comprehensive, and invaluable', and clichés like 'embark on this journey together'. The SKILL.md explains how to humanize text by removing these AI patterns while preserving meaning.",
