      "keystrokes": "cat > output.txt << 'EOF'\nHere's what I wanted to share about our new mobile app.\n\nWe've built it to work smoothly with what people are already using, and the design is solid. It's not perfect, but it does what we set out to do.\n\nThis release is a big step forward for how we connect with customers. Based on what our team's been saying in testing, the app feels straightforward to use and actually helpful. We're looking forward to getting it into people's hands.\nEOF\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat > summary.txt << 'EOF'\n- Replaced AI buzzwords and marketing jargon (\"transformative solution,\" \"leverages,\" \"empower users,\" \"pivotal moment\") with plain, direct language\n- Removed overly polished phrasing and clichés (\"embark on this journey together,\" \"the future looks bright\") in favor of natural, conversational sentences\n- Broke up the formal triple-adjective patterns and corporate lists into simpler, more specific statements that sound like a real person wrote them\nEOF\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat output.txt\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
